{{Term/Store|Raw Prime Meat|Raw Prime Meats|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Raw Prime Meat can be obtained by killed [[Red-Tusked Boar]]s, [[Mountain Buck]]s, [[Mountain Doe]]s, [[Water Buffalo]], [[Snowcoat Fox]]es, [[Maraudo Wolf|Maraudo Wolves]], [[Wasteland Coyote]]s, [[Cold-Footed Wolf|Cold-Footed Wolves]], [[Tabantha Moose]], [[Great-Horned Rhinoceros]], [[Honeyvore Bear]]s, and [[Grizzlemaw Bear]]s. Alternatively, it can be purchased from the travelling merchant [[Mezer]] near [[Dueling Peaks Stable]]. When eaten, Raw Prime Meat heals one and a half [[Heart]]s. Raw Prime Meat can be burned by [[Fire]] to create [[Seared Prime Steak]] or frozen by [[Ice]] to create [[Icy Prime Meat]].

Either Raw Prime Meat or a [[Raw Bird Thigh]] is required to make [[Prime Meat Stew]], [[Salt-Grilled Prime Meat]], and [[Prime Meat and Seafood Fry]]. Among other [[Meat]]s, they can also be used to make [[Creamy Meat Soup]], [[Glazed Meat]], a [[Meat and Mushroom Skewer]], [[Meat Pie]], a [[Meat Skewer]], [[Copious Meat Skewers]], [[Meaty Rice Balls]], [[Monster Stew]], [[Pepper Steak]], [[Steamed Meat]], and a [[Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]].

